rl\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/syn-flood-attack-prevention-automation-script/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">SYN Flood 攻击防范：自动化脚本的实现与分享</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/SYN-flood.webp 1536w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/SYN-flood-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-06-06T18:02:21+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t06/06/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>SYN Flood 攻击防范：自动化脚本的实现与分享</span></h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>最近几天，我发布了关于本站遭遇攻击的记录。由于我并非安全领域的专业人士，且缺乏应对如此大规模攻击的经验，因此在初期判断上出现了一些偏差。从最初怀疑是内部自爆，再到认为是伪装 UA 的恶意流量攻击，经过一段时间的分析与反思…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/syn-flood-attack-prevention-automation-script/\"><span>阅读全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/website/syn-flood-attack-prevention-automation-script/","retrieved":1749232022128},{"title":"流量攻击续篇：用 IPSET + 脚本动态封锁攻击 IP","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/ipset-script-block-attack-ip/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">流量攻击续篇：用 IPSET + 脚本动态封锁攻击 IP</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/data-backup-Secure.webp 1536w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/data-backup-Secure-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-06-04T10:01:33+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t06/04/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>流量攻击续篇：用 IPSET + 脚本动态封锁攻击 IP</span></h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>昨天我记录本站正遭受一场大规模的组合式攻击，手法是“伪装 UA + 全球分布 + 高并发探测”叠加而成。经过一系列尝试，最后我写了个脚本，把所有来访 IP 实时记录进了 visitors.log，然后筛查那些访问次数超过…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/ipset-script-block-attack-ip/\"><span>阅读全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/website/ipset-script-block-attack-ip/","retrieved":1749102545741},{"title":"救救我！网站遭受大规模伪装 UA 恶意流量攻击","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/user-agent-traffic-attack/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">救救我！网站遭受大规模伪装 UA 恶意流量攻击</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/wordpress-security-1920x1009.png 1920w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/wordpress-security-768x403.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-06-03T13:57:16+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t06/03/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>救救我！网站遭受大规模伪装 UA 恶意流量攻击</span></h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>昨天发了篇日志，我说疑似是 OneAV 插件（微步木马扫描）引发的内耗，导致博客流量、负载高居不下。后来我把该插件删除了，博客就访问正常了，睡了一觉起来发现……仍然有持续不断的流量消耗，反正比平常高不少。 然后我开始排查…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/user-agent-traffic-attack/\"><span>阅读全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/post/user-agent-traffic-attack/","retrieved":1749102545741},{"title":"一次被 OneAV 插件“内爆”的服务器排查记录 🚨","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/kill-oneav/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">一次被 OneAV 插件“内爆”的服务器排查记录 🚨</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/wordpress-security-1920x1009.png 1920w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/wordpress-security-768x403.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t